  "description": "KOGFAQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C150 H112 Nd4 O22,C7 H8. From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.860-3.974 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.33-108.77°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C150 H112 Nd4 O22,C7 H8. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
